fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"applib/gstappsink.html#gst_app_sink_get_leaky_type","fragment":"\n\tgst_app_sink_get_leaky_type\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSink.prototype.get_leaky_type\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSink.get_leaky_type\n\nReturns the currently set GstAppLeakyType. See gst_app_sink_set_leaky_type\nfor more details.\nParameters:\na GstAppSink\nThe currently set GstAppLeakyType.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nReturns the currently set GstApp.AppLeakyType. See GstApp.AppSink.prototype.set_leaky_type\nfor more details.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSink\nThe currently set GstApp.AppLeakyType.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nReturns the currently set GstApp.AppLeakyType. See GstApp.AppSink.set_leaky_type\nfor more details.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSink\nThe currently set GstApp.AppLeakyType.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});